<div class="identity-login">
  <div c-class="sheet_class">
    <c-wordmark c-size="'sm'" />
    <div class="identity-login__lede">
      <h1 class="identity-login__title">로그인</h1>
      <p class="identity-login__hint">이 서버에 저장된 밑줄과 목차를 봅니다.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="identity-login__form" method="post" c-action="action_url">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrfmiddlewaretoken" c-value="csrf_token">
      <c-field
        c-label="'사용자 이름'"
        c-name="'username'"
        c-value="username"
        c-input_type="'text'"
      />
      <div c-class="password_field_class">
        <c-field
          c-label="'비밀번호'"
          c-name="'password'"
          c-value="password"
          c-input_type="'password'"
        />
      </div>
      <c-if cond="has_error">
        <c-sync_stamp c-tone="'error'" c-label="error_message" />
      </c-if>
      <c-button c-label="'로그인'" c-html_type="'submit'" />
    </form>
    <p class="identity-login__footnote">
      계정은 서버 관리자가 만듭니다 · 회원가입은 아직 없습니다
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
